  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-04-04T11:55:06.785Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I want to get remainder of long when divided by an int, but currently have to do this by computing a - ((a / b) * b) which is too many nodes to want to even bother.",
